dates go_date_type_renamed v1
description "The same file as ../go_date_type.cal, with the alias the note of its W001 gives; check says nothing, and every target takes it. Its own alias differs from the other file's only so that the two go through the targets side by side"

inputs
  received : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31

date date_(due) = received
  + 30 days
